[{"client_msg_id":"0FE893E4-FDB9-4C47-BAA0-82BFAD7C6B3E","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分この辺\n\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11190|https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11190\u003e","ts":"1630930558.176800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"1212x364px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11190|#11190 lsp: \"Go to references\" only works with open files\u003e","text":"*test*\n\n*Describe the bug*\n\nWhen using *Go to references*, the extension doesn't find references in files that are not opened in the editor.\n\n*To Reproduce*\n\n```\n// a.ts\nexport const a = 0;\n```\n\n```\n// b.ts\nimport { a } from \"./a.ts\";\n```\n\n```\n// c.ts\nimport { a } from \"./a.ts\";\n```\n\nOpen `a.ts` and `b.ts`, go to references of `a`. No references in `c.ts`.\n\n*Expected behavior*\n\n`c.ts` should appear in the panel.  \nThis makes this feature useless if you have to open every file in your project to find references\n\n*Screenshots*\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52361520/123939794-d236df80-d998-11eb-9aa9-28149f6619cf.gif|reference\u003e\n\n*Versions*\n\nvscode: 1.57.1 deno: 1.11.3 extension: 3.6.1","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52361520/123939794-d236df80-d998-11eb-9aa9-28149f6619cf.gif","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"suggestion, lsp","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1625046516}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eT0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1159CBE7-52B0-4AA6-80E3-ACE8E06174B1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"その挙動は確か（ \u003c#C025RG58AAE|tech-deno\u003e だっけ？）で話題になったので一応知ってるではあるんですが、同一ファイルとかでも動かなくて多分クラッシュしてそうなんですよね","ts":"1630930550.176600","team":"T03C4RC8V","repla